Project Methodology
This project follows a business-first analytics workflow:
- Define business questions.
- Profile source datasets.
- Build relational relationships.
- Clean and validate the data.
- Create reusable SQL views.
- Build a master analytical dataset.
- Analyze sales performance.
- Identify trends and seasonal patterns.
- Examine external variables.
- Apply forecasting.
- Build interactive Tableau dashboards.
- Translate findings into operational recommendations.
The approach combines data engineering, business intelligence, time-series analysis and business interpretation.
